OL,3,GNEWSAWhat we learned about Wythenshawe
OL,4,Aafter interviewing 100 of its residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe spent much of the summer speaking to
OL,7,Fpeople in Wythenshawe - 100 of them to
OL,8,Fbe precise - to try to capture its
OL,9,Ffirst century in the words of those who
OL,10,Fhave lived it.
OL,12,FThe project was set up to mark 100
OL,13,Fyears since Wythenshawe Hall was
OL,14,Fdonated to Manchester Corporation.
OL,16,FWith 100 interviews, it was not a small
OL,17,Fundertaking to work on but the first
OL,18,Flesson we learned was just how
OL,19,Fclose-knit Wythenshawe is.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
